# Dev tools only. requirements-dev.txt is the hashed lock compiled from this file, installed alongside
# app/requirements.txt; it's constrained to that lock, so a dependency the two share gets the same version.
# Regenerate it after editing here, or when installing both locks together reports a conflict (from the
# repository root):
#   pip-compile --allow-unsafe --generate-hashes --strip-extras requirements-dev.in
-c app/requirements.txt
